    <p class="lede">
      <code>QuoteGraph</code> is the five-stage Sequoia Auto Insurance chatbot that the rest
      of this site measures. You do not type it. You clone the repo that ships it, run the
      tests, and read the same node contract you learned in
      <a href="/ezgraph/tutorial/">the first tutorial</a> — at production size.
    </p>

    <div class="callout tip">
      <span class="label">Source of truth</span>
      <p>
        The tutorial is the repository:
        <a href="https://github.com/picoflowio/ezgraph-demo"><b>github.com/picoflowio/ezgraph-demo</b></a>.
        Every snippet on this page is a reading guide into that tree. If a line here and a
        line there disagree, the repo wins.
      </p>
