          <a href="https://github.com/picoflowio/ezgraph-demo/blob/main/test/quote-graph/quote-graph.scenario.json">quote-graph.scenario.json</a>.
          Type the user lines verbatim. The bot lines are the actual
          <code>response</code> from that run — not the judge rubric.
        </p>

        <p>
