          to <code>.env</code>, set <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code>, then start the app (port
          <code>8000</code>). The demo defaults to SQLite at <code>./data/sessions.sqlite</code>;
          MongoDB and Cosmos settings are needed only if you select those stores:
