        <p>
          The benchmark already counted this change. Five edit sites on EZGraph, fourteen on
          the LangGraph twin. Do it in the clone:
        </p>

        <ol>
          <li>Write <code>nodes/discounts.node.ts</code> — prompt, tool, handler, <code>nextStep</code>.</li>
          <li>Add <code>DiscountsNode?: NodeStateValue&lt;…&gt;</code> in <code>quote-graph.state.ts</code>.</li>
          <li>Add <code>[DiscountsNode, "quote-intake"]</code> to <code>historySpaces</code>.</li>
          <li>Add <code>DiscountsNode</code> to <code>registerTurnNodes(…)</code>.</li>
          <li>Change coverage's <code>advance(QuoteNode, …)</code> to <code>advance(DiscountsNode, …)</code>.</li>
